`destroy()` ထဲမှာ listener ဖြုတ်ဖို့ မမေ့ရ။

### 5c-3. Chat embed inbound
[ChatEmbedApp.vue](src/embeds/chat/ChatEmbedApp.vue) `onParentMessage` ([L95-L175](src/embeds/chat/ChatEmbedApp.vue#L95-L175)) မှာ:
```js
if (data.type === 'FS_CHAT_BOOKING_SYNC') {
  widgetRef.value?.syncBookingUpdate?.(data.payload || {})
